      "derivationNotes": "Same dark sidebar layout. Single panel center with avatar block (circle 96px, mono uppercase initials, orange #e04820 ring), then a profile-edit form: Display Name, Email, Bio, Default Provider (Anthropic/OpenAI/Google chip selector), Default Model dropdown (mono font), Timezone, API Token (mono masked value with copy/regen). Footer with Save (orange primary) + Cancel buttons. No API keys grid — that lives on Settings."
