      "deriveFrom": "design-ai-agent-playground-run-history.html",
      "derivationNotes": "Reuse RunHistory's dense table shell. Replace top metrics with Unread/Read tabs. Rows are notification events: status dot in semantic color (failed run = red, success = green, tool-call alert = purple, info = cyan), event message ('Run run_8e4f… failed: tool timeout' in JetBrains Mono for the run-id portion), agent chip, timestamp (mono), and a 'Mark read' / kebab menu action. Drop the 'Live tail' toggle. Add a 'Mark all as read' secondary button in top bar."
